  "schema_note": "For CAP-021 network integrations, the authoritative path is region -> network -> asset -> screening mode. Status, sellability, limits and roadmap_date live at the mode leaf. These fictional Elva integration states do not describe the upstream provider's standalone product. CAP-022 and CAP-025 are unused in this lean pack; IDs are not reassigned. CAP-026 identifies unusual patterns in ingested transaction data and produces scores or alerts for analyst review; it does not determine that activity is criminal or guarantee detection. CAP-027 ingests vendor-provided behavioural and device risk indicators or scores for use in fraud rules, alerts and case investigation; it is signal ingestion, not an Elva biometric authentication product. BioCatch is named as an illustrative provider only: the Elva connector and its status are fictional, and no partnership is implied."
